  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Smokestack Lightning**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **Eternity Jam**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Rhythm Devils**: rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **encore call**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Werewolves of London**: rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2018-02-24.mk41.nolamule** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 176 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n- **dco2018-02-24.mbhoKA500.flac16**: source not stated; 18 songs; 174 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- George Porter Jr. played bass at this show, and Oteil was absent [1]\n- George Porter Jr. played, Oteil did not; the encore break was only about a minute and was left attached to One More Saturday Night [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2018-02-24.mk41.nolamule**: taped by nolamule; transferred by nolamule; source: Schoeps MK41s(DINa)> KCY 250/5 Ig> PFA> Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]\n- **dco2018-02-24.mbhoKA500.flac16**: taped by teamikoiko; transferred by teamikoiko; source: Source: MBHO KA500 (DINa, OTS, DFC, 11 ft) > Naiant PFA > MixPre 6 @ 24/48 [2]. Also: Transferred from SD card to hard drive, converted and resampled to 16/44.1 in Audacity, then tagged in Foobar2000 [2]",
